{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-01","purpose":"建立对双曲抛物面 z = x² - y² 全局形态及原点马鞍特征的直观认识","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"欢迎来到多元函数微分学的几何世界。今天我们要探索一个非常特殊的曲面——双曲抛物面，其方程为 z 等于 x 的平方减去 y 的平方。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"双曲抛物面 z = x² - y²","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 - y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 - y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 - y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"z","value":0,"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:section.value","expression":"number_01"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 - y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"请观察这个曲面的整体形状，它看起来非常像一个马鞍。请注意看最中间的原点位置。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:1:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"聚焦于原点(0,0,0)附近的马鞍结构"}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:1:2:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"在原点处，如果我们沿着前后的方向看，它是最低点；但沿着左右的方向看，它却是最高点。这种既是波谷又是波峰的点，在数学上被称为鞍点。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:1:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"马鞍面结构特征","items":["原点 (0,0,0) 处梯度为零","沿着 x 轴方向：向上弯曲（波谷）","沿着 y 轴方向：向下弯曲（波峰）"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-02","purpose":"分析沿 y = 0 截面切开的抛物线，说明原点在 x 方向上的极小值性质","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们来到双曲抛物面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方的前面。观察这块像马鞍一样的曲面，中心的原点形态非常特殊。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:2:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察双曲抛物面的整体马鞍结构与中心原点"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"当我们用平面 y 等于 0 沿着 x 轴方向切开曲面时，得到的截面曲线是一条开口向上的抛物线 z 等于 x 平方。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 \\quad (y = 0)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:2:2:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 - y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:2:2:3","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"沿着这条抛物线看，原点 x 等于 0 恰好是它的最低点，也就是在 x 方向上取得了极小值 0。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:2:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"聚焦截面抛物线顶点，理解其在 x 方向上的极小值性质"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-03","purpose":"分析沿 x = 0 截面切开的抛物线，说明原点在 y 方向上的极大值性质","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们来看另一个关键方向。请观察这个形似马鞍的三维曲面，中心的原点非常特殊，在不同方向上呈现出截然不同的弯曲状态。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:3:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"引导观察双曲抛物面的马鞍结构"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"当我们用平面 x = 0 切开曲面时，得到的截线是一条开口向下的抛物线 z = -y²。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"x = 0 \\implies z = -y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-02-moment-02-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:3:2:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = x^2 - y^2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"沿着这条抛物线看，在原点 y = 0 处，函数值 z 取得了局部极大值 0。这与之前沿 x 方向看到的极小值正好相反。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:3:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"强调原点在 y 方向上取得极大值"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-04","purpose":"通过平移截面交互与对比，总结梯度为零处鞍点的数学定义与特征","beats":[{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"我们在三维空间中重新观察双曲抛物面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方。可以看到，原点处的曲面形态就像一个马鞍。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:4:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察双曲抛物面原点的马鞍结构"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"原点虽然梯度为零，但沿 x 轴方向它是波谷，沿 y 轴方向它却是波峰。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:4:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-02"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-04:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"现在请你拖动滑块平移截面，观察平行截线极值点的变化，体会在原点邻域内不同方向上的极值反差。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:4:3:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":1.5,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}]}},{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:step:section-04:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"总结来说，梯度为零仅意味着切平面水平。当不同方向上的弯曲方向相反时，临界点既非极大值也非极小值，这就是鞍点。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:action:4:4:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-04-moment-04-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"鞍点的几何特征","items":["梯度 ∇z(0,0) = 0（切平面水平）","沿 x 轴方向 (y=0)：z = x²，呈现局部极小值","沿 y 轴方向 (x=0)：z = -y²，呈现局部极大值","结论：梯度为零的临界点既非极大值也非极小值"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0-region"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"通过观察双曲抛物面 z = x² - y² 在不同截面方向的极值反差，我们明确了梯度为零的临界点不一定是极大值或极小值，这种点被称为鞍点。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["surface-saddle-point-analysis-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"]}}
